<title>HONG KONG: Team Concepts year net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Team Concepts year net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.47 gain   vs 24.04 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  35.70 gain  vs 10.67 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    7.82 profit vs 54.17 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     697.56	vs 635.04</p>
<p>    Company name		 Team Concepts Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Team Concepts manufactures telephones, answering machines and electronic educational products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of 30 percent interest in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
